What is Cloud Computing?
👉 Delivering computing resources (servers, storage, networking, software) over the internet on pay-as-you-go basis.
What are the types of cloud?
👉 Public, Private, Hybrid, Multi-cloud.
Explain IaaS, PaaS, SaaS.
IaaS: VM, storage, network (AWS EC2)
PaaS: Platform to deploy apps (Elastic Beanstalk)
SaaS: Ready-to-use software (Gmail)
Advantages of cloud?
👉 Scalability, cost saving, high availability, global access.
